s concerned. We need to address this in a separate PR.) Another important reason is that in the early G+H driver (~CUDA 12.2 IIRC) the performance of `cudaMallocManaged` was better than `malloc` in certain use cases. The gap is closing but still not on par AFAIK.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cupy/cupy/issues/comments/2374915696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null}}

